"The dialog show the elements-number on the y-axis. The x-axis displays There "
"are diffent kinds of isotopes, some are stable, some are not. The unstable "
"isotopes can decay as alpha-rays are two diffent beta-rays. These "
"differences are encoded by using diffenrent colors."
msgstr ""

