#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1069
#, no-c-format
msgid "Will I ever have to pay for &kalzium;?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1072
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No, never. But the author always welcomes a nice mail or a DVD as a "
"<quote>Thank You</quote>. &kalzium; is licensed under the <ulink url="
"\"http://www.gnu.org/licenses/licenses.html#GPL\">GPL</ulink>, so you will "
"never have to pay for this program."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1080
#, no-c-format
msgid "Will there ever be a &Windows; version?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1083
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No, at the moment not, but you can download the source and make your own "
"&Windows; version. It should not be a big problem, because it is written "
"with Trolltech &Qt; libs. But what do you need &Windows; for? Get the latest "
"&Linux;, and live on the edge."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1095
#, no-c-format
msgid "How can I contribute?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1101
#, no-c-format
msgid "Support me with data."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the world of science, the progress is quite fast. If you ever find an "
"incorrect or missing value, please drop me an email."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1113
#, no-c-format
